Dialogue: 9,0:00:10.31,0:00:13.53,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}哇 那座山好大啊
Dialogue: 8,0:00:10.31,0:00:13.53,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}わぁ～！ あの山おっきい～
Dialogue: 9,0:00:13.53,0:00:16.30,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}真的欸 那是什麼山啊
Dialogue: 8,0:00:13.53,0:00:16.30,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ホントだ なんて山なんだろ？
Dialogue: 9,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.17,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}那是磐梯山
Dialogue: 8,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.17,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}あれは磐梯山です
Dialogue: 9,0:00:19.01,0:00:24.88,Text_Top,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,30)}海拔{\fscx50} {\fscx100}1816{\fscx50} {\fscx100}公里 是入選了「日本百座名山」的名山呢
Dialogue: 8,0:00:19.01,0:00:24.88,Text_Top,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,93)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}標高 １，８１６メートル 「日本百名山」にも選ばれてる 名峰だそうです
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.21,0:00:27.83,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}不愧是班長 真是博學啊
Dialogue: 8,0:00:25.21,0:00:27.83,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}さっすが委員長！ 物知りだね
Dialogue: 9,0:00:27.83,0:00:30.62,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}也沒有 我是在手機上搜出來的
Dialogue: 8,0:00:27.83,0:00:30.62,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}いえ スマホで検索しただけですから
Dialogue: 9,0:00:31.04,0:00:33.30,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}喂師傅 快看那座山
Dialogue: 8,0:00:31.04,0:00:33.30,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ねえ ししょー 見て見て あの山！
Dialogue: 9,0:00:33.76,0:00:36.75,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}別吵！現在正打到關鍵的地方
Dialogue: 8,0:00:33.76,0:00:36.75,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}うっせえ！ 今 いいところなんだからよ…
Dialogue: 9,0:00:36.75,0:00:37.81,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}你這傢伙...
Dialogue: 8,0:00:36.75,0:00:37.81,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}よっ… この…
Dialogue: 9,0:00:40.32,0:00:42.96,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}今年回老家這麼熱鬧 真好啊
Dialogue: 8,0:00:40.32,0:00:42.96,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}今年の帰省は にぎやかでいいねぇ
Dialogue: 9,0:00:44.58,0:00:46.82,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}老媽你倒是優哉游哉的
Dialogue: 8,0:00:44.58,0:00:46.82,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}母さんは気楽でいいよ
Dialogue: 9,0:00:47.20,0:00:48.13,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}有嗎？
Dialogue: 8,0:00:47.20,0:00:48.13,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}そう？
Dialogue: 9,0:00:48.53,0:00:50.70,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}那座建築是什麼
Dialogue: 8,0:00:48.53,0:00:50.70,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}何？ あの建物～！
Dialogue: 9,0:00:51.01,0:00:53.17,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}確實 奇怪的形狀
Dialogue: 8,0:00:51.01,0:00:53.17,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ホントだ 変な形
Dialogue: 9,0:00:53.17,0:00:54.61,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}奇怪的形狀～
Dialogue: 8,0:00:53.17,0:00:54.61,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}変なカタチ～
Dialogue: 9,0:02:35.95,0:02:36.76,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}什麼？
Dialogue: 8,0:02:35.95,0:02:36.76,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}What!?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:37.03,0:02:39.35,Text_Bottom,,0,300,0,fx,{\pos(815,1008)}你們兩位都要出去一段時間嗎？
Dialogue: 8,0:02:37.03,0:02:39.35,Text_Bottom,,0,300,0,fx,{\pos(815,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}お二人ともしばらくいないの！？
Dialogue: 9,0:02:39.61,0:02:43.15,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}每年這段時間我們全家都會去外婆家裡
Dialogue: 8,0:02:39.61,0:02:43.15,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}この時期は毎年 おばあちゃんちに 家族で行ってるんだよ
Dialogue: 9,0:02:43.42,0:02:46.10,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}所以暫時不能一起玩了…
Dialogue: 8,0:02:43.42,0:02:46.10,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}だからしばらく 一緒に遊べないけど…
Dialogue: 9,0:02:46.10,0:02:47.34,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}但是…
Dialogue: 8,0:02:46.10,0:02:47.34,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}でも…
Dialogue: 9,0:02:48.46,0:02:50.23,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}啊…{\fscx50} {\fscx100}這樣啊
Dialogue: 8,0:02:48.46,0:02:50.23,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}あぁ… そっか
Dialogue: 9,0:02:51.57,0:02:54.06,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}我說 不介意的話要不莉莉你也一起來吧
